{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83","name":"Field Commander","source":{"id":"source:reference-5ad8d1c0fe6dab83","title":"Field Commander","revision":19901,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:49:47Z","sha256":"62799451233b1c9e1e436b80a0e8cdf10e13ff2d1a20a005930c41de4c4e8ac5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19901","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Field%20Commander&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5ad8d1c0fe6dab83","blocks":[{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Commander in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Field Commander of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is the central authority and leader who issues most of the Battalion's commands. A Field Commander controls the Battalion's movement and can also fill every other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion Position"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion_Position"}," not currently filled by another character. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can have only one Field Commander at a time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The below Actions include all Actions that can be performed while functioning as a Field Commander:\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Hard March"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", the Field Commander can move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," up to 4 times its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," until the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," cannot order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to make attacks until the end of the Field Commander's next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Aid Another"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can aid an ally's next skill check or attack roll, or you can interfere with an enemy's attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding a Skill Check"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can help another character achieve success on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," by making the same kind of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," in a cooperative effort. If you roll a 10 or higher on your check, the character you are helping receives a +2 bonus on their own check. You can't ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," to Aid Another.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding an Attack Roll"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In combat, you can Aid Another character's attack by forcing an opponent to avoid your own attacks, making it more difficult for them to avoid your ally. Select an opponent and make an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10. If you succeed, you grant a +2 bonus on a single ally's next attack roll against that opponent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", you can aid the attack roll of another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by adding your Battalion's firepower to the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["A Field Commander or ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Officer","referenceId":"reference:54aa9f7df3de3a47"}," can make a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check to grant a single adjacent allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," a +2 bonus on its next attack roll made before the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Charge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Field Commander can order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Charge, moving toward an enemy and making an attack in one Action. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," moves up to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," and then makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," in the same square or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," within weapon range.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Charging ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," gains a +2 bonus on its attack roll but takes a -2 penalty to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of its next turn. If a Field Commander orders a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Charge, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," cannot order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to attack until the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Move Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Move"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", the Field Commander can Move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," up to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Unlike Character Combat, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"}," allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to move into a square with another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". A square can hold up to two ground ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," and two flying ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," at a time. There are no direct consequences for moving past, into, or out of a square already occupied by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," (though occupying the same square might allow the enemy to target you with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attacks"},").\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Disband Unit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Field Commander can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disband"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disband"}," the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". When a Battalion ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disbands"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disbands"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", the Field Commander of an adjacent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can order that Battalion to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disband"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disband"}," also and reform with the other Battalion as a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". Any heroes or unique characters must rejoin the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," on their next turn, except for the Field Commander, who automatically transfers their role to the new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Use Tactical Knowledge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["By spending three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"},", the Field Commander can give a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," a tactical advantage. After spending the third ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check. If successful, the Field Commander can grant a single extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to any other character filling a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion Position"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion_Position"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". If the Field Commander is the only character filling a role in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},", this Action has no effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
